{
  "name": "nopCommerce: new customer → Mailchimp subscriber",
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Adds each new nopCommerce customer to a Mailchimp audience, with double opt-in."
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "28c45b3d-8d58-4890-a674-5a8c1240ea54",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New customer → Mailchimp\n\n1. **New customer:** choose your Cartenvo Integration Hub credential (scope `webhooks:manage`).\n2. **Add subscriber:** choose your Mailchimp credential and the audience (list).\n3. Activate.\n\nThe status is **pending**: Mailchimp emails the customer to confirm, so only people who agree are subscribed. To add only people who ticked the store's newsletter box, change the event to `newsletter.subscribed` and the email to `{{ $json.data.email }}` (the same field).",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6e06fea1-fa2d-42ee-a5c4-4f523d6cde0b",
      "name": "New customer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cartenvo.cartenvoTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "customer.registered"
        ],
        "format": "full",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "6557330b-300a-43d0-a3ef-a8219cd866e2"
    },
    {
      "id": "4795b6f7-e249-4926-a488-d4eca294a0f9",
      "name": "Add subscriber",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.mailchimp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "list": "",
        "email": "={{ $json.data.email }}",
        "status": "pending",
        "options": {
          "tags": "nopCommerce"
        },
        "mergeFieldsUi": {
          "mergeFieldsValues": [
            {
              "name": "FNAME",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.firstName || \"\" }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "LNAME",
              "value": "={{ $json.data.lastName || \"\" }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New customer": {
      "main": [
